SUMMARY:Fjord
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1pm\, 4:10pm\, 6:05pm\, 9:15pm\nFrom two time Palm d'Or 
 winner Cristian Mungiu\, a Norwegian woman and her devout Romanian husband
  relocate with their five children to a remote\, close-knit\, coastal town
 . Their teenage children form a fast bond with a neighboring family as une
 ase begins to simmer around their rigid beliefs. When allegations of abuse
  emerge\, they are forced to confront a system of judgement that blurs the
  lines between concern and prejudice.\nhttps://booking.landmarktheatres.co
 m/launch/ticketing/a8d9ad50-bcbe-500d-b7b8-5d14321b459f\nFrom Pushpin Bost
