SUMMARY:Fallen Angels
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Sparkling\, dizzying\, and deliciously potent\, Fallen Angels\,
  Noël Coward’s champagne-fresh comedy of bad manners\, shocked and deli
 ghted audiences at its 1925 premiere. Two upper-class wives\, their husban
 ds away for the day\, share a few toasts to their pre-marital dalliances
 —with the same man\, who just may be en route from France to visit. Old 
 rivalries and past scandals bubble to the surface in this intoxicating rom
 p from one of theatre’s comedy masters.\nhttps://booking.landmarktheatre
 s.com/launch/ticketing/6f9d1a4a-7580-5f2b-b033-714de16c6911\nFrom Pushpin 
 Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/6f9d1a4a-7580-5f2
 b-b033-714de16c6911
END:VEVENT
